    {
      "id": "6cizv1b",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "3.4 Climate"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Andhra Pradesh has a tropical climate with three main seasons – summer (March to May), the southwest monsoon (June to September), and winter (November to February). The state receives rainfall from both the southwest monsoon and the northeast monsoon (October–December), particularly the coastal and Rayalaseema districts.",
      "id": "oh46fzk"
    },
    {
      "id": "ulghpbp",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Climate Feature</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Details</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Average Annual Rainfall</p>",
            "<p>900 mm (varies widely: 600 mm in Anantapur to 1200+ mm in coastal areas)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Highest Rainfall District</p>",
            "<p>Visakhapatnam / West Godavari (1200+ mm)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Lowest Rainfall District</p>",
            "<p>Anantapur (~550 mm; among the driest regions in India)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Cyclone-Prone Coastline</p>",
            "<p>Yes – especially October–December; major cyclones hit regularly</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Summer Temperature (Peak)</p>",
            "<p>45°C+ in Rayalaseema region</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Winter Temperature</p>",
            "<p>12-16°C in Rayalaseema hills; mild in coastal areas</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Northeast Monsoon Contribution</p>",
            "<p>Significant for Rayalaseema and southern coastal districts</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
