      "level": 2,
      "content": "3.5 Districts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "After the bifurcation of Andhra Pradesh in 2014, the state had 13 districts. In 2022, the government reorganized and expanded to 26 districts. The original 13 districts (pre-2022) are important for exam purposes.",
